{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14926","headline":"题念济寺晕上人院 · 卢纶","name":"题念济寺晕上人院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泉响竹潇潇，潜公居处遥。\n虚空闻偈夜，清净雨花朝。\n放鹤临山阁，降龙步石桥。\n世尘徒委积，劫火定焚烧。\n苔壁云难聚，风篁露易摇。\n浮生亦无着，况乃是芭蕉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14926.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14926","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}